kiss-sprint
________________________________________________________________________________

This package preserves the exact /usr/bin/kiss script installed when this
snapshot was created, under /usr/bin/kiss-sprint. It is kept separate from the
upstream kiss recipe and does not replace /usr/bin/kiss.

The snapshot is compared byte-for-byte with /usr/bin/kiss and identified by its
Blake3 checksum in checksums. Refresh files/kiss-sprint and the checksum when
you intentionally capture a later installed version.

Run kiss-sprint version to inspect its embedded package-manager version.
